Mobile Business Process Management (BPM) refers to software platforms that enable organizations to design, execute, monitor and optimize business workflows directly on smartphones and tablets. By leveraging touch enabled interfaces, offline synchronization, native device sensors such as GPS, cameras and barcode scanners, and AI augmented low code tools, mobile BPM extends traditional BPM capabilities to field workers, remote teams and mobile first enterprises, delivering instant access to critical process data wherever the work happens.
