What is Mobile Business Process Management (BPM)?
Mobile BPM platforms act as an extension of enterprise wide process orchestration engines, translating complex workflow logic into intuitive, touch friendly experiences on handheld devices. They support a full spectrum of BPM functions – from process modeling and automation to monitoring, analytics and continuous improvement – while adding mobile specific capabilities such as real time video capture, augmented reality guidance, and sensor driven decision making. This enables organizations to break the “desktop only” bottleneck, empower frontline staff, and reduce latency between data capture and actionable insight.
